    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8820b7d8-723e-432d-a841-ef5a1204f513">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">You: I got, I got dirt
on you, on you, You... I’m keeping my eyes on your dirty soil!</Text>
