      <Text> Cauliflower</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ac56663-3828-4f10-8934-33bde604b743">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Do not mess around because my roots are in da underground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="509656ed-7493-4e23-beb3-9d1f5882e36d">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">If you stuck around, we’ll have your stems making muddy wet sounds.</Text>
