      <Text> CAULIFLOWER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95565ba5-cfff-4c22-b691-39dc6634f36e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Dat</Text>
      <Text> lil herb’s on da own lil island-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9fd604dd-b39c-485a-86bd-ceb68f4f9f6d">
      <Text>Money turns into rain. The ocean descends, washing Pyrus away. Parsley’s sea legs break. Fear swallows him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb0ae085-30be-47b0-aff2-ed80ce028d2a">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9665533d-82ae-4b62-8338-54c9c82d74e8">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Can a, can a plant drown?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
