      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">DJ</Text>
      <Text> Cauliflower</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e3c82d5-001b-4ecb-a00c-6f52a4a6ba0f">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">If water reaches our stems, we in trouble
When da bar ain’t yours, time behind bars is doubled!</Text>
