    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f2efc50-cbb5-4591-8f7b-831428d89837">
      <Text>Pyrus (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="569bd7a2-ff2c-401f-8add-da824fc3c61b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">I need you... You need to...
I need to, I need two bars of rest!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
