          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NURSE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Hospital Hallway - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba5bd55f-4777-4f05-9a0a-bdb9ef84d1d4">
      <Text>Rau sits on a chair, trembling with anxiety. Malus rushes in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4929a4b7-e0d1-4d09-bc91-715636d05f68">
      <Text>MalUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="022554cf-44c3-41a8-82de-b8796a6eee42">
      <Text>Is Parsley alright?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="373caef4-0dff-463a-bbcd-b44e338257c2">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f597cdb6-1497-4fe4-8d57-9ba77f27d4bb">
      <Text>He’s not going to the light, no thanks to Pyrus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7ada66f2-d34a-4f61-9ecf-5929caf02ba8">
      <Text>MaLUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98fc903e-98d6-4aa5-9af4-ae4b5512669d">
      <Text>I’m always here for you, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d682191-cf4c-4772-bb0e-35671e90fcd9">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0050e914-cd67-4cd5-bd2c-9af27065dc03">
      <Text>You’ve lost an ally.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3afc1003-7fbd-45c3-9ff2-68ec77820feb">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c06407c-e3c1-4eb3-8ae9-a62500f2fe43">
      <Text>I also lost the plot... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text> is in trouble. Dirty City’s shutting us down. They got proof.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="39e33121-f6a0-4c83-911d-7a6d0ba59038">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9646ddc-04d5-4c52-adbb-843777e88a56">
      <Text>The proof in my son’s stoma...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="744a6ff3-ae3a-43b3-aace-68257e5d7fe8">
      <Text>MalUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="046e2f9b-ae24-4faf-ba44-9dd162498bfb">
      <Text>Underage drinking... Perpetrated- Encouraged by my own sprout.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42cbf9a8-d408-463c-9c6f-9e9122729512">
      <Text>Rau holds Malus’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db69c5da-07f1-46b2-ac1c-1e8f93734dc6">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="70f490d7-3713-401e-ac2f-5d035b6e5f9b">
      <Text>I’ll give my testimony...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0635095c-bce5-486c-802f-b27b3c0d39c5">
      <Text>Malus smiles. Rau briefly sees visions of Cori Anh dance by.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63c723ff-7468-42c0-85c3-e66c03344ae7">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e363537-c58c-49dd-a156-211e62f799d2">
      <Text>...against you and every Fig.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7c490a6c-f7f1-409e-91d2-cfed7c19928c">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a133d90-175c-46d3-806a-90c886b4b9d7">
      <Text>We have more in common with transplants than you’ll ever know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6b5f359-8fa5-43db-9aa8-e82de3b6abdd">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="134c3232-483e-4e89-9b4b-333584141226">
      <Text>I was not born yesterday.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2c749eb-04d0-4492-b86c-be5bdbade31e">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d8db987-15d2-4b21-a927-3edb7dcb709e">
      <Text>I was born on this soil. Yet, it ain’t always green on this side for me, a Fig.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3b37c05-646f-4fe4-8443-80e860f8e720">
      <Text>Malus, looking genuinely hurt, turns and exits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d94d9aed-8f3a-4407-8951-5af1f6d7344e">
      <Text>A </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">nurse</Text>
      <Text> approaches Rau.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bfda0470-8c17-4809-bdbd-5db420991d57">
      <Text>Nurse</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b596556-328f-486e-90bd-48837c1e373b">
      <Text>Your son is now awake if you’d like to root with him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BULLDOZER DRIVER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUS DRIVER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Hospital Room - MomENTS LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b96b5a0c-2894-44c6-97df-54a3430fecf1">
      <Text>Rau holds Parsley’s hand while he lies in bed. Parsley is unable to speak with tubes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a79ce15-fecd-4178-9434-d42f86a8d745">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e220fb05-1c47-47bd-ac0c-9d2681c57278">
      <Text>Parsley, did you soil yourself? Listen to me. You are never allowed anywhere near Pyrus. Understand?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2893d747-56cc-497a-adfc-4fece42a60f7">
      <Text>Parsley stares at her with fear and resentment in his eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="69dc6475-3fa0-4678-805c-5ba76f9c0026">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5274d97a-e91f-41d1-8799-2b0b4c9ac7dd">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Text:</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">A month later...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f0b59b68-94f3-4909-bba3-9fd594bd5a62">
      <Text>Parsley sweeps with hollow strokes. Outside the window, the bus idles. Pyrus and Bombus board. Across the street, Malus hammers "plywood" over the vibrant doors of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="66eaa443-84a0-41cb-8efe-25c68425f294">
      <Text>Rau (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6fd67540-283d-4593-8399-489aafc41ede">
      <Text>Be spotless, Parsley! No dust!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="96e26bc3-d263-4ee4-b0ba-16c9c4bfc261">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b5a0ee44-3ceb-48a5-891a-b22805a63464">
      <Text>(to himself)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19872155-1e99-48db-b31e-04b625b5e6c5">
      <Text>There’s no spot here. But maybe, there’s a spot there. Dust off-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="57c259e9-d3a4-43d3-9fe9-17c4e4c4542a">
      <Text>The bus pulls away. Parsley drops the broom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="56cd2ac9-db77-4edd-9190-bc9d866d1ea3">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAILPERSON">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Dirty City - Streets - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca6e5b4b-416f-4d2f-b374-97d063c73553">
      <Text>Parsley sprints down the road, chasing the bus’s exhaust. It pulls ahead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3e4835f-8bf4-4350-90ce-14e9ca9cf18f">
      <Text>The mail truck runs over </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro’s</Text>
      <Text> mailbox again. The mailperson (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">woodpulp</Text>
      <Text>) leans out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ece59d2-f8de-46d7-8957-43e5df8d9311">
      <Text>Mailperson</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="29be8470-c7f0-4a4c-8b51-aa1f12c49123">
      <Text>Need a ride?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e206323-ac9d-4d61-b57c-57defbeffeb2">
      <Text>Parsley dives into the passenger seat. He points ahead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae209679-2dd9-41b8-923e-0e17a3c35063">
      <Text>ParslEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3044afc7-6069-426f-b46b-8409ccf6e702">
      <Text>Follow that bus!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5cb985c-42d2-434a-98fe-a842f9e0b30e">
      <Text>MailPERSON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ac35704-5abe-48fc-983d-a8e9ba62773d">
      <Text>Part and parcel, Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4c0c416f-7c38-48a3-ae49-6f8103d2e871">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="61" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOMBUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAILPERSON">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Bus - Moments Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f206fb96-72a9-4fa9-8e35-044394d46959">
      <Text>The mail truck pulls alongside the moving bus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b3ee065e-73b5-4cb0-9cac-e4547a173615">
      <Text>MailPERSON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5dc82f93-7a07-4d86-911f-047888b8197a">
      <Text>Special delivery!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3c96f019-aa0f-495d-9dd0-636f0c5f4091">
      <Text>BombuS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2ed5aec-4dce-4195-b672-b1157d5ec819">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Buzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2bd4647-05d6-46e8-aabd-58365600ccdf">
      <Text>Parsley leaps from the truck. He nearly slips, but Bombus nabs his overalls, hauling him through the open bus window and onto the seat next to a stunned Pyrus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="f7d945e8-aa22-468c-8367-aeb6b536665a">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81fd574b-bde9-4d23-bde6-8db2824232e1">
          <Text>ParslEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8ef94e5d-fd88-4229-b75e-4188c902e228">
          <Text>Pyrus!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d7c9d2e4-184b-43f8-9b2b-d152d60c2fd3">
          <Text>Pyrus</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="69ec2524-6b3f-4eae-909f-72aa9d9a251a">
          <Text>Parsley?!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ff15a24-0b6d-4c18-a6e4-b062d9e9508b">
      <Text>The kids embrace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eba633bc-e6c1-4788-a3aa-5d980448c8e0">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b4a7414-e0d8-4bfe-b704-d32e25dbdd91">
      <Text>What will your mom say?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="787d5c09-a0a9-4d24-963d-54e0ea994664">
      <Text>RaU (PRE-LAP)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="614ae652-7132-475f-9157-b6c092bff8fc">
      <Text>Parsley!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="61" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="abc30e5b-574b-47dc-81ef-afcc24f1de09">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Rau</Text>
      <Text> enters the main salon. The broom lies abandoned. The front door swings wide in the wind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5d3e4d07-139c-428d-a0cc-a08b1d3d5b98">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="61" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Montage:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82226411-21b6-4374-85d8-16aab30c0dc4">
      <Text>- Rau paces the salon, a phone to her ear. "My son’s missing! Parsley Ram! He’s green... everyone’s green! He’s an herb!"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5db5eb60-482f-423a-86f1-378aa539d4a7">
      <Text>- Night falls. Rau stands under a streetlamp, clutching a stack of "Missing" flyers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f6c2da9-72f7-4731-83c9-971d604b2e6e">
      <Text>- Rau sits in her office, staring at her own Green Card. It feels heavy and worthless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d960e20b-222a-47a5-a389-a3e633ee8994">
      <Text>- Rau collapses on the salon floor, surrounded by darkness. She let out a broken sob.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8966d38c-fba1-4dc8-bf64-9e8f8c494873">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">End montage</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66a239f8-5d2d-4c0a-83ad-f6b393983764">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Pre-lap:</Text>
      <Text> The cries of children.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1b029aae-b55b-4c9a-9298-334ed30f5c34">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="61" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CORI ANH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SAPP AGENTS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Dirty City - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4db0c0a-f8d7-4f10-9502-d8212702fbce">
      <Text>An armored SAPP vehicle idles. Agents toss a family of </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Yucca </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">Validas</Text>
      <Text> into the back. The steel doors </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">slam</Text>
      <Text> shut. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8b17719-9f1f-4869-ac8e-05fd1a5d4a38">
      <Text>Nearby, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> checks off a name in the booklet Rau gave them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c8a7e126-3b53-489c-8115-441006794465">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d18b1e7-992a-414b-8efa-4ca5ad0dd7db">
      <Text>We got the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Validas</Text>
      <Text>. Next transplant-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c855fe64-f6fb-46a8-99df-0e0f10841058">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Montage: Uprooting</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c855fe64-f6fb-46a8-99df-0e0f10841058">
      <Text>- </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Ext. Terracotta PotHouse</Text>
      <Text>: </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> kicks in a door. Dirt spills out. Agents drag out a transplant family.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7bb2da88-5a14-413d-86d3-6fbb64e20ac9">
      <Text>- </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Ext. Street</Text>
      <Text>: Agents detain herbs on the corner.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bafec229-ac99-4191-9744-9718a93d7d25">
      <Text>- </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Int. Apartment</Text>
      <Text>: Agents drag a weeping vine out the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b41cea5b-d466-4771-bc11-b6b9b2f0ee30">
      <Text>- </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Ext. Street</Text>
      <Text>: An armored truck slams shut, muffling cries.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a0250fc-4697-4ae2-a458-9075b1142d0b">
      <Text>- </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> crosses out name after name in the booklet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d71e8316-4f98-403c-8bbc-e470d7e9e853">
      <Text>Sapp Agents (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72b9a1ab-0538-4249-a3ac-00ba04878a23">
      <Text>Uproot! Uproot! Uproot! Uproot!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64892beb-647c-406f-bc96-1c16468022d4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13af59f4-db10-47a3-9752-70a3484ae526">
      <Text>The best part is no one shall see us do this in the shadows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e2d6289-9f80-4434-a824-d665316f1e83">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Boom</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> breaks into another terracotta pothouse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65c5ea47-f9a9-4614-a964-ea07e5760897">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">End montage</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef7a29b2-0fb9-4ad7-b4da-24b5cad0f56e">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Rau’s office in </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3dde34be-976e-4833-a5fa-49c1f5f1eac6">
      <Text>Rau sits in the dark. On her TV, a muted news feed shows a declining population graph. The Mayor sadly speaks at press announcements. CHYRON: "</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dirty City ramps up uproots</Text>
      <Text>."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28d7dffa-6579-45de-9afb-0549d5174353">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="365a76d7-9068-4920-be83-5082bba9e856">
      <Text>Everything’s on fire because of me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ef3c338-852b-4c4c-bdb3-408122ec5000">
      <Text>She slams her head onto the desk. The herbal model of Cori Anh topples, falling into an open drawer. Rau reaches in to retrieve it, but her hand finds a thick </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">calendar</Text>
      <Text> instead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d76d894f-5229-44c0-aa1c-1f37db9312ab">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">"Take Your Pick" Song</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f005a12c-f966-417e-9887-1763632eeecd">
      <Text>Rau puts the calendar on the wall. It’s a mosaic of daily </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">polaroids</Text>
      <Text>, ending abruptly at June 20. She rips them down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="15592e34-8227-4ae6-99f0-02cdf2731acd">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f0e5a18-c5e5-436f-a456-b599ded02833">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Change your life
by knowing which is which
Choose your smile
Take your pick</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f005a12c-f966-417e-9887-1763632eeecd">
      <Text>She fans the photos like a flipbook. We see Parsley grow from a sprout into a more discontent boy. She stops at the photo from Cantaloupe Outlets. Parsley and Pyrus, smiling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b209b210-24c8-4f03-a4e0-11df35b1c551">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc869dc4-4d22-40f1-bb9e-ac2e2e7a56d4">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Change your life
by picking which
Choose your smile
Take your pick</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2da881ea-b77b-4c02-ab71-843ade1745c8">
      <Text>Rau looks at Cori Anh’s model. He becomes lively in her mind. He puts on a crop top and reveals his Fig emblem.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5da8860d-677f-4af6-ba60-1a83c6a6c406">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6d03359-d8b5-436e-aeeb-76347c4836cc">
      <Text>Why did you choose to be a Fig?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75de2d0b-667d-41bc-9f51-6fa2d19970fc">
      <Text>Cori ANH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="551f212f-028a-4cd2-b5e8-314922aad4f3">
      <Text>A chose? Those you love are born one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5deba576-4d69-4cea-8676-30035d5ebcc8">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="124026b6-daa4-4d67-9e9a-a4dcbb3f7c0f">
      <Text>Those I love are not born monsters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b0f8e02-8ca6-4486-97a9-4958543848d6">
      <Text>CorI ANH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="03153a16-55d7-4274-bd9e-a64218bd13b3">
      <Text>Maybe you’ll learn to love an "unnatural monster" someday.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1bbe5a1-80a8-434a-8b4f-7a8a2a7ed7a0">
      <Text>The vision fades. Rau stares at the photo of Parsley, Pyrus, Malus, and Bombus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e71e181-15f4-4549-b5a4-ec25b0b8acfb">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fe77cb35-9d0b-4425-a29f-171b13badb85">
      <Text>My son is not a monster. I am the one who is unnatural.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="510be760-dc25-4eaa-a878-74da8292445b">
      <Text>She grabs Parsley’s camera—the one filled with photos of SAPP's violence. She scans them, logs into Parsley's social media, and hits </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Post</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="818ee9fc-1658-420f-a025-ddedebdba907">
      <Text>The view count </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">explodes</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f83869c-278f-48fe-8acc-c636b296c4ba">
      <Text>Rau pulls up the City Hall auction site. The next is August 3. "</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>" is on the list.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="016e7ba0-0f66-4b02-9d38-5d353b204a39">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fe5a9f3a-8539-4483-8e32-663a4b48e3f0">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">I will take the pick!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f83869c-278f-48fe-8acc-c636b296c4ba">
      <Text>She pins the kids’ photo onto the August 3 calendar square.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d76d894f-5229-44c0-aa1c-1f37db9312ab">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of "Take Your Pick"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="1d320b91-3d75-450d-b607-e00bd1e3f4b8">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of ACT </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Underline+AllCaps">II</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="657e2c52-0f3d-473a-b975-4f677f9c4cb7"/>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="657e2c52-0f3d-473a-b975-4f677f9c4cb7"/>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="657e2c52-0f3d-473a-b975-4f677f9c4cb7"/>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="657e2c52-0f3d-473a-b975-4f677f9c4cb7">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">Act III</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="64" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. City Hall - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95b60639-ffdc-4f4b-812b-955b2b05fbf4">
      <Text>A "City Auction" banner hangs outside a government building.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f7666ff7-8721-47e1-a378-993b2124944c">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="64" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COUNT CELERY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. City Hall - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1195b6d6-77ca-4ff3-8bfc-8a8def1ea8f6">
      <Text>Wealthy plants pack the room. On stage, </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Count Celery</Text>
      <Text> (70s) points a gavel at an orphanage photo. Next is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b674867a-d60b-4d01-862f-b74857506c1f">
      <Text>Count Celery</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20357b74-9be0-4336-8dfe-a9dfceb6e9a1">
      <Text>And sold to that fine asparagus there. Have fun with the orphanage.

Next is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>. Opening bid?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="006019e3-1c12-4026-a3bb-449468d74e12">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee2c9706-9d18-4c8d-a0e2-6e41f0255a0c">
      <Text>One million!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1dc1ed0-7016-4cb1-8dc7-ca885ffb9a6a">
      <Text>Rau swiftly stands up. The room gasps. Count Celery grins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="18c8e190-98b2-410c-b6cb-1bee5517f63b">
      <Text>Count Celery</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30ea9053-adf2-4af7-b37f-5f9502e53958">
      <Text>Wow! Someone wants to get turned up. And I don’t mean the turnips. One million. Going once. Twice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c78fc70-0bb0-4682-9b07-712959ce0c62">
      <Text>The heavy doors </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">slam</Text>
      <Text> open. Alton Dandy strides in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd7d4ade-2d5e-4242-a68d-7af5290db256">
      <Text>DandY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35e6b93d-4143-470a-9a2d-0fc3728865c3">
      <Text>One million and one!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1fb51c78-85b9-4219-8335-de22b626990f">
      <Text>Count Celery</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26197536-cd8e-45a6-ae3d-da4bdd27e965">
      <Text>It’s Alton Dandy of All Dandy Properties. That dandelion is always one upping other plants!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="915adedc-06ed-4ee3-b6e2-87be6923ebfc">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c69a8ea-51e6-449d-852b-f8b6df21631a">
      <Text Style="Italic">That Dandelion with a fly</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="15bea81c-e456-44e4-bce1-ea1e9ddb39aa">
      <Text>DanDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bec173d3-9ef4-4928-b8b6-2c5a402e828e">
      <Text>Still struggling, herb? It’s dandy to have an off-soil bank account.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65eea095-57c9-4a15-8bc5-2953ee371922">
      <Text>Count Celery</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a86fb96c-4b31-4c66-afc0-8cc832c56574">
      <Text>Going once. Twice. Sold to Dandy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ab47a4d-f1ba-4243-9340-71ab25202f42">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b703eef-13ab-4831-b732-c84a2a214e93">
      <Text>I cannot wait to bulldoze it and turn it into another golf course with artificial grass serving us!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3240977b-a679-44d6-99f8-3fd2570312c8">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bdea954c-e36e-4795-b348-e8b45ad43e7e">
      <Text>Guess it’s time to roll out Plan B.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7da5b5ed-5a35-4977-be6f-152cd8a687e1">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Pre-lap:</Text>
      <Text> The sound of breaking into a house.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="65" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a550a19-daeb-4d60-b198-0407f076cec8">
      <Text>Rau kicks in the door, hauling chains and watering cans.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="794585bc-c212-4fbd-8958-70f4dfc8a975">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d8f02f2-1162-4c1f-82f6-6295c4a02e39">
      <Text>Breaking and rooting...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b703f19a-7816-420f-b6d1-078984315641">
      <Text>She chains herself to the floor joists beneath the skylight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0fb817f1-4092-4735-a9ee-d8257cb469e2">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Time jump:</Text>
      <Text> Sunlight hits Rau’s face. She wakes to the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">thud</Text>
      <Text> of boots. Dandy and a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">demolition crew</Text>
      <Text> enter with dynamite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f0f5718-ab8a-4a26-b2ca-b8240120ae57">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac6966b7-8754-4ca4-9262-8b0a8b3e801a">
      <Text>No squatting on a Dandy Properties!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="202074b9-198f-4ccf-9e2a-e3b25b46fed8">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18d6b9b4-7153-4dae-af2d-e0172188eaa8">
      <Text>This plot belongs to the Figs!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11356a26-66be-4ffd-940c-036c349fafa1">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6aa88d1-4500-4566-873d-365e9db2d5ea">
      <Text>Prepare to be a figment of my imagination. Confiscate her water!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77e4fe3e-cee0-4585-b677-ef8eeb80d0db">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f13ed71-90c3-4d85-b0ec-623e0a7e0c5d">
      <Text>I can wilt, but Figs will never!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4faef37-dc35-4ddb-8922-2e4fe32bf7fb">
      <Text>The crew </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">steals</Text>
      <Text> her cans. They march out to a crowd outside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="af7a7b05-264a-468e-9827-099ed232c158">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="65" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PROTESTORS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="REPORTER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d673b8ce-2cff-4c62-beba-0a7e739b63d3">
      <Text>A reporter shouts over a swarm of </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">protestors</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2fe3da25-2524-4041-9a62-20cd00585fcb">
      <Text>Reporter</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d7714914-573e-41c9-b60f-f0f6a7ee0eec">
      <Text>...viral footage of SAPP brutality has sparked a massive turnout! Inside, a lone cilantro is chained in protest for transplant rights-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a11a2d5b-e0c0-4f86-8f61-06e8f93555cb">
      <Text>A group of </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">figs</Text>
      <Text> sprint past, </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">snatching</Text>
      <Text> the microphone..</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17de69e9-026d-412a-bde6-f8083a46278d">
      <Text>Protestors</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17a1825f-6767-4db4-9a76-1e1fb1070715">
      <Text>And Figs’ rights!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="65" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="REPORTER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">The Beach - continUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b3c41f43-fa98-42bd-a837-512b30adfbb6">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> sprawls on a towel. Their radio crackles with the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">reporter’s voice</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80918033-035d-4f5d-88b1-756678222af3">
      <Text>Reporter (Radio)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="644c040e-7940-4ae2-8359-f62c49789b38">
      <Text>You heard it here, fruits and vegetable. Progress for transplants and Figs. And a cilantro is leading this fight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="348c0757-4968-4efd-b0b9-8312aa189576">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0ddc14e0-3f08-4b3b-a67f-2f906095a625">
      <Text>There’s only one cilantro who can put up a fight. But it can’t be...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c159690-45fb-4d6b-a4b9-6b882c55de7d">
      <Text>Reporter (Radio)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca4cbb88-bf87-4c2e-a997-e8f770652cc3">
      <Text>...one protester got a word from the leader...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="50f9a7ac-abdf-49f2-9b7c-ea59b6e94189">
      <Text>Rau (RaDIO)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3fafb75d-6198-4599-b884-79d36592e79d">
      <Text>Smile for the camera, Woodwork!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f21d3772-65f7-41fe-925c-3ccdbae83699">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RHIZO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9051a0a-fef2-4fcb-9bb2-a4b72c93e544">
      <Text>It is her! My one day off from uprooting and she’s a martyr!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5575949-e8fb-46f7-a0be-69492bdfb499">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">bolts</Text>
      <Text> upright and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">kicks</Text>
      <Text> the radio into the sand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="66" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">INt. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Figleaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Dusk</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="22616702-0cac-42a4-81b6-16655cfa9f5b">
      <Text>A </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">helicopter crew</Text>
      <Text> boards up the ceiling. Dandy supervises.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63d51a65-404a-4eea-87de-7eba62a17645">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="43112388-f9d3-4da6-93ba-515779d6b5e4">
      <Text>The sky is the limit... But, I have no limit... with water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="66" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Figleaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - conTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a520129-53ea-470d-b438-f1667bb434c6">
      <Text>Police vehicles swarm the streets. Cops (mostly Broccolis) trample protester's tents and water cans. They form a line. A SAPP truck pulls up. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RHIZO</Text>
      <Text> steps out with a megaphone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5a092a5-d7f1-4e1f-888e-f0e893013e6a">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The screen splits</Text>
      <Text>: </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> outside, Rau inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72145ba5-94f8-4d93-a1df-206224aafdc6">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d9fce78-9bcb-429c-9d96-dab975932a5d">
      <Text>Rau!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22a5c1b2-c040-4d1a-b7dc-a8fa1a56cad7">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="80f64662-0e02-47fc-9ee4-c31815010187">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f6985ee-9027-4b57-9827-f267220229cb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e496292-4ee6-43a0-9413-bb69ca7fc8ff">
      <Text>What are you doing? You’re above the soil. You’re with the top plants now. Don’t get in the way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="720b278c-cef9-44d2-93d7-ca4e5f713874">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88342dae-10b2-4e16-94a2-c8fa9091196b">
      <Text>I love my roots...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f1c209da-21da-41d5-9153-8959e8d260b8">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67c82f4f-7cdf-4bd1-9bf7-0e35973a6fd3">
      <Text>I gave you your Green Card, I can take it away!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05ee5be0-f05a-403b-a1af-a74c160d48d6">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ed906f9-0428-465d-a536-26be1eaff7d7">
      <Text>Ha! That’s what I tell my son: "I seed you, I can </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">unseed</Text>
      <Text> you!"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5a7f0d7-e988-4897-8d15-04a0eb16d6a7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8c1eb9a-92dc-4226-99d3-67c5e530c1c1">
      <Text>Don’t come out for the Figs or the trans. Come out for your patriotic </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Woodworkans</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b99f76a1-eace-4014-b62f-26882099e3c9">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0cbfae75-a10b-4343-8544-080196c18eb3">
      <Text>For once in my life, I will stay for my friends...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="48ab1cd9-30f5-4e0b-8ebf-d8c5a147165e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85b87261-915b-484e-83d6-fa2dcf596c47">
      <Text>Your green privileges ends...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d76d894f-5229-44c0-aa1c-1f37db9312ab">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">"Lose your Color"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="188c9c56-c512-4212-a080-fbad63c4c955">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> gets Rau’s case file and signs the "Termination" line.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="67" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b3a53241-d0f8-4b7b-8d58-1acdd25c093c">
      <Text>Rau sees her green hand fades to red. She tries to save the green to no avail. She checks the card. It burns in her palm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="acf2bb82-fc58-4f3d-b8e4-1415d32f6cac">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Rau’s Vision</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="769b7ca6-d0a8-4f1b-95b3-ca630e4b7ce1">
      <Text>Cori Anh slips away into the void.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="311f8e76-d133-49aa-be68-091034675ab7">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Pre-lap</Text>
      <Text>: The sound of ripping paper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ab02d28-a209-463c-a88c-adc17aee3133">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of "Lose your Color"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="67" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text> - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7164c93-4040-49bf-9fc4-1b77a08e14b8">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> shreds the green card. Dandy holds the megaphone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41044de9-79fc-4696-994e-fa50dab2d826">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e85c0b8-d544-4a6f-9316-d9b492e01684">
      <Text>Soon as these wildflowers get bored of the limelight and get out the way, I </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">will personally</Text>
      <Text> uproot you and have you deported back to that muddy garden from whence you came.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7164c93-4040-49bf-9fc4-1b77a08e14b8">
      <Text>The protesters hold their ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="67" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cf529358-c245-487a-9495-9f730e73f848">
      <Text>Rau weeps into her red hands. She stares at the photo of her and Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e689adcb-aea6-4a6f-ada4-fa07e75f892a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="67" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Pyrus'S HOUSE - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="859efd62-7312-4f4c-9428-94db7355e5a0">
      <Text>Pyrus’s bedroom is illuminated by a TV.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="67" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANCHOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BROADCASTER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Pyrus’s Bedroom - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52689f3a-9b1b-4033-b10c-82cfd5c026c6">
      <Text>Bombus flips channels on a TV remote. Parsley</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>and</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>watch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c79f5f81-e2a2-4958-b199-08284aafac44">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f178df2-b498-494a-8fd8-88129bdcb4cf">
      <Text>How do bees watch TV with five eyes-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="09f79dd9-351b-46f1-ad8d-398040c39e2f">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="502b576f-1b58-4647-bec5-cbf15343386b">
      <Text>Question: How do plants have eyes?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b70ddf01-e288-4619-b193-9d35856dd29b">
      <Text>The channel briefly flips to footages of Rau then sports.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b84d20a-c221-4744-84e0-7c315b1e2be1">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6219b799-a6ae-4945-855a-906c9031bcef">
      <Text>Mom</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">?</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2b6b35d-7214-4872-8eb7-f5fa408299c0">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5be39b8f-bf5a-4277-ab46-97ad96f43dee">
      <Text>We do get our eyes from our moms...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44e20411-e157-45ce-b32a-aa5d3748b757">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d8cb908-d813-4d93-a74b-bc0fd1e27da2">
      <Text>No! My mom’s on TV! Flip back the channel, Bombus!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="897ab70d-7dea-4275-a61f-bacf3eb74dc3">
      <Text>Bombus flips from the bee sports channel to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">WoodTV</Text>
      <Text> news.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c5aea4b4-8e36-40a8-8e28-2f84e647430a">
      <Text>Anchor (TV)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e90c874-2e02-4e54-81dd-1c964ae77bba">
      <Text>...a defiant cilantro has become an international sensation. She’s been without water and light for days...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="94aa7b21-25d1-4a24-891c-8acb69623981">
      <Text>Bombus flips to a bee sports replay, showing an injured </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">bee</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="955ec2f8-051a-49dc-8b0a-abdf893d3c9a">
      <Text>Broadcaster (TV)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1ac4a716-3688-4ad9-bde1-88580c1e0ba2">
      <Text>Oh! Let’s watch the instant replay. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="39354b90-5cf4-4ca6-8af3-bcb955e9d7dd">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35f9eb27-9c4a-4c61-bae6-462495fd7073">
      <Text>Ya mom’s trying to protect </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="99abae2b-3627-4168-b943-f1903e31cd09">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e190a88c-62f2-4cb9-8bcf-28116e2a0178">
      <Text>She’s gonna wilt if she doesn’t stop </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">this instant</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00440e62-83d4-4baf-9bf5-afb86b9c4f1e">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="65ada446-ba14-41d8-a65b-e93cf99e74ff">
      <Text>Ya mom’s gonna die?! For </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>? Do you need a ride?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba42a954-5912-4ce8-bb70-e333de5dec61">
      <Text>Parsley tears up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="68" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. All Dandy Properties Headquarters - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1076ca85-2866-47eb-9aaf-94a19fe0aeac">
      <Text>The headquarters contain many dandelion-inspired buildings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2126dfe2-7b3c-4095-b927-44ffd0d460e7">
      <Text>DandY (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf6a11be-3899-4307-831f-7dd8db8e85a9">
      <Text>I thought it would work...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="68" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. All Dandy Properties Conference room - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b28db6f-0168-47a9-84c7-f6e00b1fa280">
      <Text>Dandy paces back and forth. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> flips through Rau’s file.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c037363-d508-4104-b438-58e6c00845f5">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc8d227a-d113-47e0-9493-d008d799a48a">
      <Text>I thought the light-block would break her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca296528-5942-4a78-b630-56d3c9dc9fcb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="453d69af-8a2c-43f2-9fee-af9d45a19b6d">
      <Text>She survived the Paddy War. A little shade won't make her wilt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d48d7506-d0b3-4c30-bd80-9a744d549afb">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be0d0969-d9bc-40a1-bcc9-28267a91e31c">
      <Text>It’s a PR nightmare! If she wilts, my stock drops to the bedrock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e2eb68a-4126-4243-a0a2-206053ce2658">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09eeffc1-913f-4e7e-810d-c5c1baf9029b">
      <Text>Do you dandelions really need to own another plot of land?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4b79f2f3-b2bb-4596-8f5b-b7632e224e06">
      <Text>DanDY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd195060-3db6-49cd-9b33-cda9b9d45e58">
      <Text>It’s the family business.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fce50431-b641-48ce-8a4e-5eb967e83ba7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> stops at a photo in the file: Parsley and Pyrus at the salon. He looks at Dandy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="662718ba-7f9c-4539-b55f-415d676b5b68">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e3f509bf-d441-464e-a097-318a39a8fc77">
      <Text>Let’s draft a compromise deal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da6a8253-aa22-47cd-9c4c-024ef11bfd49">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00a8f427-5dbd-44ef-9057-3b88ff969434">
      <Text>Dandelions don’t compromise. We get a better deal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e02fd8a-6742-4e2a-b62b-0a9c760911ab">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e3f509bf-d441-464e-a097-318a39a8fc77">
      <Text>It is. If she leaves </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>, you don't bulldoze. You get your bid refunded, plus priority on all future housing developments for the Department of Garden Security.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4fef33c8-f586-4171-994a-c6abe50a9275">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33686805-2aed-4461-b52d-cb2d66838685">
      <Text>And the cilantro? Since she’s red-handed again, she can’t legally own that salon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29e76de9-1a64-43f0-b51b-3ad86e9ad73c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RhIZO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7d0642f-890c-49e4-9b22-f32c9c5028ae">
      <Text>The salon will be yours.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b3e8c4a-fe01-4721-b9ab-ff98fb45fcbd">
      <Text>DandY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b032c59-8084-410f-882f-59908d2ef62b">
      <Text>Caught red-handed. All Dandy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1871c6d1-694b-4e1f-92d2-402a27ccb1bc">
      <Text>They shake leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d651f842-8c5d-42da-bd50-1722619d186c">
      <SceneProperties Length="6 3/8" Page="69" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUFF">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BULLDOZER DRIVER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LANK">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RHIZO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Figleaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> / Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Figleaf</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Day - Intercut</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e2a047a-b76c-478b-ba7d-18052a8870e7">
      <Text>Rau, barely holding on, clutches a photo of the kids.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e619d18-a1e2-404b-80ff-f77e75da8948">
      <Text>Outside, a bus screeches to the curb. Parsley, Pyrus, and Bombus hop off. Pyrus elbows through the massive crowd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d246020f-8d41-46d2-a9e6-a809c40e9900">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a039dd22-c6dd-4948-b557-62390c32d6c8">
      <Text>Get </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">outta</Text>
      <Text> the way, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">community</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c05a959e-f4ba-488e-8fbb-d82e962d3c8f">
      <Text>At the barricade, the cops block them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c05a959e-f4ba-488e-8fbb-d82e962d3c8f">
      <Text>Bombus hoists the kids to the boarded window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d8da423-41cf-419b-929f-0e03ee8a6957">
      <Text>Parsley (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1efe3f82-49d6-4054-9e99-771623f10698">
      <Text Style="Italic">Me</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">(Viet: "Mom")</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd727852-99ea-4f2b-8226-90b9badac45b">
      <Text>Rau lowers the photo. She sees them. New life surges through her stems. She </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">tears</Text>
      <Text> her roots from the floorboards and stumbles to the exit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="409d79d8-4d7f-41ea-9b73-89a90470c6c5">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7f7d4cce-1988-45d6-b638-ee9b972f6316">
      <Text Style="Italic">Con </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">trai</Text>
      <Text> (Viet: "Son")... and Pyrus...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e43d90fe-17cf-4e03-a092-a5cf54109305">
      <Text>As Rau emerges into the sunlight, the crowd falls silent. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> and Dandy watch from the bulldozer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3559ec7f-5709-4731-8432-3fd1d3041521">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4861a9a0-1694-4e93-a8e2-2eb4eba167eb">
      <Text>She’s not dead. But the deal’s is!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c475b063-3198-4ab8-9527-e9825f5d2182">
      <Text>Rau hugs Parsley. The protestors cheer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44016ccf-fca5-4e0f-94b9-4a14b93332a2">
      <Text>Dandy </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">shreds</Text>
      <Text> the agreement. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> barks into a megaphone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e00ce4a-63ed-4efa-b440-58e805c2a5f4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0bfdc199-09aa-4d9a-966e-2d6bc182049a">
      <Text>Bar the soap! Bar the soap!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c67b7cb2-0aed-4c6c-881d-43ef7771922e">
      <Text>The cops seize Rau. The crowd </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">roars</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4deee7dc-8c48-4140-848b-918125caf17e">
      <Text>Bombus dives at a protestor’s megaphone, emitting a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">deafening sonic buzz</Text>
      <Text>. The cops recoil. Pyrus nabs the megaphone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b6a5262d-d36f-418c-8b41-ace8b509a396">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a17e344b-98e8-4ec6-9120-2263171169e8">
      <Text>(Through the megaphone)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="23897adf-ddda-4660-8d10-b26af94d2a66">
      <Text>Plants of the law. When did you kids grow up to be hall monitors? Isn’t it your job to protect property? The property that have provided you refuge. I’ve seen many of you be your true selves here. I’ve seen you all fabulous.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39fce09b-d673-4392-8c99-cd8c1c243ed6">
      <Text>Several cops blush, lowering their batons. They step back, refusing to hold Rau.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fd1e40b-0375-45c9-b2b2-75b2b593a227">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cba86980-3b97-4987-980b-c0013bb03011">
      <Text>You will amount to anything...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e1acd57-0c1d-48d1-aee8-1077c9a7ad7f">
      <Text>Dandy barks out orders to the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">bulldozer driver</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="32b77d53-fdaa-4334-8d0b-6927fb8f3528">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a1dcd381-5938-48c3-89db-41d25f3a9675">
      <Text>Uproot this alliance!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f1d7d55-8d14-4b63-a5ca-cbedd9818513">
      <Text>Bulldozer Driver</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57028d1f-9956-4e03-bb64-4cbdd0e995f2">
      <Text>Look, uprooting a community-led peaceful gathering is one thing. But </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">the Broccolis</Text>
      <Text>. I’m a transplant-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fde4a75a-f166-48f6-9150-83f47850e7ac">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> hears the bulldozer driver say they’re a transplant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f626bbe1-3174-4d5e-a36e-cc8b60e68a63">
      <Text>Dandy shoves the driver out and takes the wheel, dispersing the crowd. They ram FigLeaf. Instead of crushing it, the bulldozer’s giant trowel </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">scoops</Text>
      <Text> the building, flipping it upside down into a pile of rubble. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f626bbe1-3174-4d5e-a36e-cc8b60e68a63">
      <Text>Pyrus looks shocked.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="495e412e-9404-4a29-a884-d97ce01bc9f1">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="879ac545-f960-461b-9396-a65cc44e3fb9">
      <Text>(Sobbing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="14212d91-52fa-4a77-8d11-f21f98041969">
      <Text>All a figment of nothing...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4037b00c-d6a5-4554-af93-dee7df44944e">
      <Text>Parsley holds her red hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8959ef10-553e-48a7-bd37-3265ae924c84">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="767f9650-2391-4a26-9d54-2fa0e69fc730">
      <Text>We still have </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae5a103d-5882-4d97-abdb-4c27b2aa30bc">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34cec3c2-0482-4185-838b-b2010215f8ca">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro’s</Text>
      <Text> not mine to own anymore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="938896b2-28d2-409d-8e02-e11bdc18cc9d">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8c74618-3e47-462c-97d7-371de17dcfdc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> is not just home to us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5464eb0a-0b25-4dde-972b-776111d88e22">
      <Text>PyruS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9417f18-8cda-4466-9994-f526d719ee6b">
      <Text>It is home for me...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5a53b3c-0f8c-48be-8b45-b508f92bf325">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="059b6540-aaf9-4464-a0b6-8982fc7bd7bc">
      <Text>...and this community!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="434cca43-bcb9-43e9-b09e-4c27199961b7">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="741db0cb-cf69-4bf6-aafe-716249e83578">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vamos</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4381f4e5-2252-4460-bc8c-c0eea6ef4368">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="741db0cb-cf69-4bf6-aafe-716249e83578">
      <Text>Bombus. Get back up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a42f17f-9cd7-4d7d-9915-497dcce604e7">
      <Text>Bombus rockets into the sky. The trio head inside </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c3514e83-fce9-4aea-b780-94e1fc647238">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b18f4bd0-33d8-44bb-aafe-fdc8402223db">
      <Text>Two Sapp agents (</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Lank</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Buff</Text>
      <Text>) arrive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b18f4bd0-33d8-44bb-aafe-fdc8402223db">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> pulls off the gloves of the bulldozer driver, revealing blue transplant hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9af7db8-fb08-4528-93c9-f4b1e0cd387e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a7b714ac-02ef-47a2-b800-7b7030a385a0">
      <Text>Don’t want to get my leaves dirty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a5482ae-af7a-405c-8575-846ff6bbbddc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> approaches the emboldened Dandy in the bulldozer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b81f4467-409b-4111-995b-946fb4383a7f">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e4923ca-7934-4bcf-9f1a-a40508119b06">
      <Text>With </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>, this be a two for one deal today or what? All Dandy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba27e0b8-5e1c-4648-886a-6ed00107b143">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c52426f9-0883-4f76-96f7-ee4dd625710b">
      <Text>I need a word with you about your... </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">trans</Text>
      <Text>gression.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cf7a79f9-4292-4a00-8283-89993da0c260">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> and two agents (Lank and Buff) march towards the salon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f41279a3-353c-49e2-beca-fec68e076a36">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd228941-5aa7-4533-95b4-4c3751e64ea5">
      <Text>Rau collapses from exhaustion. Parsley and Pyrus drag her into the office, slamming the door as the Agents </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">burst</Text>
      <Text> in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="984bc905-f74b-4eb3-a75f-dbe53f04f204">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="341d8c6f-7bc5-4f63-9ef1-b4b157a05eb5">
      <Text>Mom, please don’t wilt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a04d4f91-f982-4c42-8fbc-5fc410097311">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07af7e8d-d8dd-4679-8efd-b5a261551310">
      <Text>Wada we do, tutor?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af6dbaf6-8b40-43e6-87ee-7edee6901a54">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e1160f2-2c68-434f-9b03-2d7d731db0fc">
      <Text>Give ‘</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">em</Text>
      <Text> a free tan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d1517ff4-3b70-408d-95dc-437392670746">
      <Text>Parsley hands salon tools to Pyrus like weapons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d6d0265-b5ec-4fb4-a281-9661d7b7b36d">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="84fbf5f9-0344-431d-bcbf-6a458b62b133">
      <Text>Ya learning from me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="204257d2-5b88-46a4-9f44-1db2633d9739">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4cd3caf6-425a-4c99-ae05-16ccc9360ad0">
      <Text>Teachers learn most from students.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="63dc3006-be49-4dac-acc8-770bbfa1a895">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6eb1ad73-e68f-41cd-acc8-d02bbb344c13">
          <Text>PyRUS</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c4fc104a-2e7b-4ec4-983b-59ce9f98977e">
          <Text>Tangent...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7305c29-0ce4-43e5-9e8a-3b76e75bcf7c">
          <Text>Parsley</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7c0c1998-72a7-4ac7-a778-e199c7d4c3cc">
          <Text>...Secant!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a3ffc1f-150a-491f-bc7a-83ae446fe17f">
      <Text>The kids </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">blind</Text>
      <Text> the Agents with spray and facial cream.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55f5ba08-f3fd-4f65-833a-37678a7555ee">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d429fb29-5c13-4392-b630-1a7d000034f7">
      <Text>Complimentary leaf spray?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="09689d72-bc64-4397-b4aa-beef733b87e9">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f47bba2-e49c-4eb4-8669-074f18e8b7f2">
          <Text>Lank</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="211664d7-25f3-4ecf-8994-4d5e48bae773">
          <Text>Weed killer?!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6bebca59-7355-4d77-a441-bb2a5aa44734">
          <Text>Buff</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79ca70ae-49a6-479c-82df-7cebd5686b7e">
          <Text>I’m high... Highly allergic!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="adf82aec-5ea2-4f71-ad32-817859fb5952">
      <Text>ParsleY &amp; PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a4e634b-4c49-4cd0-90ea-002aff803e9e">
      <Text>Need to cleanse them pores?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="089950de-b642-4d0b-8c64-1b7ffd0b93ea">
      <Text>Lank seizes Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0dc821d-ff7e-4152-8c40-b35bfcc82c3b">
      <Text>LANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a836f84-8852-426a-9923-a8a8d02dc4f9">
      <Text>Imma put pores in you, sprout!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dcf4bfe3-2785-42a0-b547-e3a383736bae">
      <Text>But Pyrus tricks Buff into punching Lank, causing Lank to land in a tanning bed, unconscious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="905983cf-d7dd-4896-b05d-e28bcb92a7f4">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec0c871d-dce3-473f-a51d-2aae21d3f69e">
      <Text>Hitting people is wrong!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2a880c0c-5408-4f8a-946e-463c0b0d21ed">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35413f63-76f1-42b4-8222-3437fa370b43">
      <Text>But it feels so right!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d661fabc-ec1f-49f3-b11c-2af19cf8c228">
      <Text>Pyrus whips Buff’s behind with a wet towel, sending them skidding on a puddle of cream. Buff slides across the floor on a service cart and into a second tanning bed. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Slam</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b358f4fc-31b6-4eee-965d-fbac236ba38d">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82fbbba6-d752-4077-9860-eb3be6dbb1aa">
      <Text>Where’s the third?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12687da3-9815-4b19-934f-df05862fe9a9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> emerges from the steam like a ghost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55bd4a76-3723-4a19-8f06-14ed0f1e39dd">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RhizO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a7c2d75a-ed63-4d0a-a4cb-fb0b567476e4">
      <Text>Seedling Protective Services?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c90a9d86-267f-48a4-923c-83a9e9331cd0">
      <Text>ParSLEY &amp; PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3683919d-46fc-4e76-bacc-f1d625549b34">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh</Text>
      <Text>!!!!!!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3fdbf098-0471-4661-9bdf-3551e320ade9">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Moments Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a74cf01f-ba8e-4582-82f6-bb8bbff9eb21">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> handcuffs the kids to the counter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9dddaa81-9ab6-478a-a830-2e19d84f6469">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2c16e9a-9c3e-4f2e-a42b-511114920dcf">
      <Text>Where’s that invasive species you call "mom?"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="283fe325-a437-44df-ac32-a90c214e1fbc">
      <Text>ParslEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d7c185c7-d34b-4d54-8e02-9d4f2147c8c0">
      <Text>She’s living the dream, unlike you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ef5ff6e-300a-4e50-8984-74d880e82dcb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RhiZO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c0aae165-00ec-4a7a-9279-63fbbf181e42">
      <Text>I dream for our garden nation to be plotted only by green hands like us-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac0045ca-0b04-42f7-be3d-89634261966a">
      <Text>PyrUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a63d23c5-52c8-43c7-a6ae-075055fd1a35">
      <Text>Hands of all colors are what make this country fruitful!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3a7568d-0a7c-40bb-b1aa-ce6eca2b8411">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RhiZO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7163a73a-9599-4ce9-afb6-76c42ffd0afe">
      <Text>It’s fruitless, kids. Nothing can change my aldehyde. I change lives.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21bf8e1d-39b0-4b17-95ac-9b1f6b3b9900">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> sees a door labeled: "Rau Ram’s Office."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee2b9546-db56-44ee-bbd1-3269deb8a4ec">
      <Text>The kids insult </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74bc8de7-27ab-418b-8961-a872e2ec140e">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Rau’s Office in </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd228941-5aa7-4533-95b4-4c3751e64ea5">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> enters, finds Rau slumped at her desk. She awakens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f56a0097-84bb-45f8-b99f-c6e2433ef438">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08dbfc98-15d5-4d6e-9bdf-41a86e0e32a5">
      <Text>Living the dream. Stay in it, Rau.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="394efdd4-cd21-4361-a24a-f4cbc3a21ff6">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f29fd50-9664-4b20-838d-bef114bb4a8f">
      <Text>Your mom would be ashamed of you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb73d03b-b074-4360-92ed-a62b6535825e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e14d6ee8-4a7d-43b6-9316-246ba8bef396">
      <Text>You don’t know her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81865d93-7df7-414e-b878-178b429140e6">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ecd9196-8f10-4dee-bcfb-3e523f200c90">
      <Text>As transplants, I know her kind real well.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a02e48b6-f1fe-4520-84d1-ebe383ce2826">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RhiZO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8051889-3c72-48b6-9a1f-ce53af01260d">
      <Text>And your kind was unkind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="be8990d4-370f-4bb3-b408-ae02de4cc584">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a873f621-a8f2-4c1e-800e-59adfbab626e">
      <Text>But you’re a child of transplants.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="10389d99-0cce-4f34-a382-00eba02c479e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83e40095-354d-48a1-9e8d-fddd9f0d3bdb">
      <Text>My twin was friends with invasive-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d427626-5c65-488c-9947-50c7b54c1864">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ef45fac-215b-40a5-8390-d8fd5254de4d">
      <Text>You’d make friends too if you don’t insult them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="711fe474-fd93-4e41-9027-42186b83d3c9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fcfc063b-ab12-435b-b445-368df1d6e5b2">
      <Text>What hurts more than insults were silence and violence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e993de85-4c33-4142-b7a6-9724c58583a3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> puts down Rau’s head on the desk and handcuffs her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a622b241-6330-4e13-8e29-fcca1225bb1c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9e89977-6731-402b-a5cd-e72fd10ea3b2">
      <Text>You have the right to remain silent. Not remain here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ff3ff1af-3465-4ace-b247-68e216a398ef">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> sees a polaroid camera. They reach for it. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>! They’re blinded. Bombus rockets in, </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">knocking</Text>
      <Text> them out. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Malus</Text>
      <Text> emerges from the rear door, holding the camera’s remote.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e59a981f-1830-4a58-b7c5-382a10c0c7ec">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a9039e1-35cb-448b-b8c7-9d0569cc1508">
      <Text>Need your keys back, darling?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fdd9e66-075c-4d97-a09b-75ae69d865c1">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74f77354-438c-462d-9136-538c4f7436e3">
      <Text>The angel came back right on time. How were you so stealthy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aff4a277-fa93-434c-b1bc-40a47507183c">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa983949-40eb-40b6-a75f-f5f14cbc7ee8">
      <Text>Agent Orange taught me a thing or two. Like flashing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce70bdb6-fc1a-456a-a142-fb95da9982cf">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Moments Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="619f9842-3931-4533-8839-6527136c9d78">
      <Text>Bombus uses their stinger to unlock the kids’ handcuffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="619f9842-3931-4533-8839-6527136c9d78">
      <Text>Malus shoves </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> into a tanning bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b8c77a1-0ed1-4c59-b3cf-9687c5cf5d95">
      <Text>From inside the tanning bed, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> sees the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce70bdb6-fc1a-456a-a142-fb95da9982cf">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Begin Flashback</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="059b2577-b87b-4a17-b00a-3f8c1520bb05">
      <Text>Teenage transplants with non-green hands beat up 8-year-old </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text>. 8-year-old Canna stops the bullies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="059b2577-b87b-4a17-b00a-3f8c1520bb05">
      <Text>That night, their </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mother</Text>
      <Text> holds </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo’s</Text>
      <Text> head high with her non-green hands. Their mother heals </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo’s</Text>
      <Text> wounds with light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5321726-c826-4bd3-b8c1-849e2077aefb">
      <Text>We see young Canna proudly look at young </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="b2940ac7-cd66-4db7-a2f9-d7648cfe9978">
      <Text>Match cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce70bdb6-fc1a-456a-a142-fb95da9982cf">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">End Flashback</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eca36365-88d8-42cd-9f27-c78a0a675d1a">
      <Text>Canna opens the bed, ready to fight, but </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> hugs instead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3c9a78cd-530b-4cbc-bfdc-78a8904512e7">
      <Text>Canna</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d76a356d-1afd-43aa-985b-dfaebdb9c200">
      <Text>I came to talk some sense. Is it no longer necessary? You take bribes?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c460f387-161f-49a3-a76f-31df80d9cade">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30c10111-f185-4fe6-8cfa-c96d502e987c">
      <Text>I saw the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2ec3613-172b-44b0-9c33-76612c8033d3">
      <Text>Rau holds up a fresh polaroid of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo’s</Text>
      <Text> "light" moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a702c620-86e1-4022-92ad-bf174c1aa719">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e014caa-f83b-4a9a-9bad-49b0f5e2ce1f">
      <Text>Before photo. How about an after?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="06a4525d-c6cf-4110-88d7-def821faa845">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="917b039c-fc4a-4129-a156-e667cdddf4eb">
      <Text>Don’t expect a green card anytime soon. Just expect a home here for the time being.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="67e4658c-907d-4a34-a9c4-95cfdbcd2aa7">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76f7df56-ef38-45d7-95ef-05aa07279f97">
      <Text>Expect two proud mothers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12327770-68b7-4dc3-8ec8-d583e1335c44">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> finally shakes Rau’s hand. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9f1cfbb-5cf1-4113-a04e-78cc9115ec72">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Moments Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c94d866-ebbb-4a4c-a480-f0e504e24e7a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> and Canna exit. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> clutches the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">polaroids</Text>
      <Text>. Dandy revs the bulldozer, aimed at the salon’s front window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1a2023a-73f7-4b2b-ad1a-3be57a7f26c2">
      <Text>Dandy prepares to drive the bulldozer into </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98d2d5f7-3bd1-45c5-a221-1751475c886c">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="71e682d7-9254-4267-b032-8ab4b4a09551">
      <Text>You got your twin on our side?! Another two-for-one deal!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b394d3e7-fda4-4b82-8266-8d192ea81e0d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">RhiZO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a37b26c-00c6-4bcf-839f-8e029db41468">
      <Text>You broke our deal with your invasive species.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da5649d6-ae64-4c65-9b9f-ff6a5c2b6886">
      <Text>Canna</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="adb47e18-a826-4873-a659-a144feea318e">
      <Text Style="Italic">Transplants</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e7b1f77d-ebf5-4a7f-9872-e436a9b15f58">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8d610af-5f3f-4229-8775-e22c9006a567">
      <Text>How many </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">transplants</Text>
      <Text> is your company harboring and exploiting?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25747ea5-f611-4ddf-94e0-8a4af466440e">
      <Text>Dandy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bdc49f5c-be49-4c26-a2e2-f0a4880ee0e1">
      <Text>That’s what you meant by "transgression..."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4c33b18-7bf9-466f-b1b2-2efbc832297a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Rhizo</Text>
      <Text> signals. The two tanned Sapp Agents emerge from the salon and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">slam</Text>
      <Text> handcuffs onto Dandy’s stalks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8905c0f7-9d14-454b-b5c2-586acf9b2ba2">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="76" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a615d7da-0097-462c-a44d-2ea833b863fc">
      <Text>The dust settles. The salon is a mess of cream and towels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c51d0162-b1be-4a66-a681-1acb723e1458">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8d4a800f-7f94-40da-87b5-db138ef1a70a">
      <Text>I’m sorry I couldn’t save Fig-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b774710f-c573-4201-b1d5-dadf246f0e30">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="010b985f-d986-4a26-bf92-fcab7fba6749">
      <Text>(Motioning to Pyrus)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83fd8bf0-f8e3-4051-a0d3-8227a617e93b">
      <Text>Save your energy, darling. You saved what matters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb8b27a1-c0c4-47f4-ad96-7c9ae48db8b5">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b05e1554-cea3-4a37-aa62-74cb629d3c07">
      <Text>I still don't amount to anything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3882b9e8-b649-498d-a512-5d7c813c773c">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7709916b-5551-4fed-b7ad-eb3d1a068fd3">
      <Text>(Nudging Pyrus)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91d94fab-1133-47e1-8640-7711796f4cbe">
      <Text>You mounted a revolution, poop-head-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6d970220-cf53-4a0e-b049-6fd2aa81b331">
      <Text>Rau rolls her eyes and looks at the cash register.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="15984160-bfbc-4385-8b39-a042648d711e">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f948a06e-6dd5-47ef-b863-e053e82607be">
      <Text>Such foul mouth- </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Anywho</Text>
      <Text>, I wasn't finished. I can’t save the old </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>. But I can save you a spot right here for the new one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f06ac7b-2216-4171-8e69-fc159d224afd">
      <Text>Rau gestures to the empty plot. The group (Rau, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Parslsey</Text>
      <Text>, Pyrus, Malus, Bombus) pull into a tight, leafy embrace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="23786653-35e4-46a4-956c-8f893f1999f5">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="77" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6a803d9-1c0d-4220-ab85-d75a9823cb1b">
      <Text>The sun sets over the wreckage. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text> is a pile of rubble, but the foundation remains.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9cf8743-a957-4918-825a-d22c5c45e3ae">
      <Text>Malus (V.o.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e89c964-475c-401e-9bdd-b21ec06e9158">
      <Text>A cilantro with a heart? Now I’ve seen everything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b28923d-ad77-4a51-8d3d-a0f48021bd15">
      <Text>Rau (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49d0f2a4-5ca3-4f07-bc75-b56573519d50">
      <Text>Don’t get used to it, Apple. I’ve still got a business to run.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77c8ec16-72e1-45f7-984e-daa4e2eb18c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 1/8" Page="77" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY, RAU, MALUS, PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY, RAU, PYRUS, MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS &amp; MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU &amp; MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="184f0382-a866-4e75-9160-a2f7a678d2d8">
      <Text>The salon neighbors a construction site with a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">fresh plot</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="469c86c0-857d-400f-8220-1fb063a872f5">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Text: End of the summer</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1bc8fa2c-99bb-4a5f-a7b5-336fdeb0a056">
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Bold+AllCaps">Salontro</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps"> - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44673b2f-3ef9-4f08-a8cf-f24f7c2ffa92">
      <Text>Rau gazes out at the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text> construction site. Beside her, the cash register is empty, except a single bill.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0b19c0f-f9d1-4b5f-ad93-eee0cb39cb5d">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50b305f8-33f2-4d4e-88c2-e85a3c8708c4">
      <Text>Slow day, Ms. Ram?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37b907f5-831d-41c1-8c41-f97e2d3b5084">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87a59b69-42cc-4f94-8fa2-f492bd51cfb8">
      <Text>Quiet day. A good problem to have.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9b02d4a-37b3-4c38-86d1-f5f178b4dbeb">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="561ee8ae-9b52-4790-abb6-db3ecf4a7b0a">
      <Text>Like me? Too bad you can’t legally own the place without a card.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4915af20-a4a0-4aff-b43f-8930a09b5a3b">
      <Text>Parsley (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ed3b936-96c8-4889-8268-df0bd8697457">
      <Text>But I can!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7f94f17-35f6-4b88-bfdd-1a8b28994b2c">
      <Text>Parsley hangs the deed. His name is scribbled over Rau's.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b170b451-ed56-4fd6-a47b-a12109de1ac9">
      <Text>PyruS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48c59b08-658c-45b9-8b26-b4fd975a504d">
      <Text>Local age laws. The Mayor...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f49762bd-2826-422b-a518-4a2f2366b90d">
      <Text>Rau nods, haphazardly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80a87a50-4427-4c27-8dcd-031382865f29">
      <Text>The bus </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">hisses</Text>
      <Text> to a stop outside. Bombus lands on Pyrus’s head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b3b03ae-6c23-4285-9d24-5cf3d6fab201">
      <Text>PyruS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e504938d-1545-427c-8524-237e545f6698">
      <Text>Welp, time to mind my own beeswax.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="87e5d084-e9c1-4625-a5d0-1d97e8270dcb">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc63c9ae-d12b-40cc-8228-cefb12d51848">
      <Text>Go back to school. Get As not Bs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="98e52756-7b1b-455a-8a9d-ebc333d6cd69">
      <Text>Bombus gets the joke, acknowledging it with their antenna.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37801d70-4a82-4991-a171-f469a9f762be">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac0bc30d-c56e-4095-8e21-d84c03893e15">
      <Text>I need school, so I don’t end up a "</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">đo</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">vô</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic"> hoc</Text>
      <Text>" ("dough </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">vo</Text>
      <Text> how"; </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Viet: "An uneducated person").</Text>
      <Text> Sorry for calling ya an invader.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36efd2b9-c40c-474b-9f21-26f29a83d886">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9f071fd-4a89-4638-b3b5-62b5acd2d674">
      <Text>I’m not who you should be sorry to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1db657bd-b2a8-42c2-90d5-63656c2963a3">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="846dd55b-182c-425e-a1f6-376468662a53">
      <Text>Little herb... I... Sor-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d2adf56-ca30-4745-b6c5-b1101e40f63f">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ceb40502-5c06-4c9b-9213-0d4b18c52bde">
      <Text>Breathe in, breathe out... Um, six carbon... Twelve hydrogen... Six oxygen...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e60678f-344f-4551-80d2-295687d4111d">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f5affe0-79f9-45ef-ac85-fe0cfcb7ea6b">
      <Text>Plus six oxygen molecules...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fd60277-801d-4503-9b6b-3639dc9ac3c4">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9694aef2-8c64-4249-ae94-ec1e903bdab7">
      <Text>Photosynthesis. Photosynthesis. Photo- I will always root for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cca16ab-c0a4-4fb7-af3e-76b250e6ee8d">
      <Text>They share a quick, fierce hug. Pyrus shoves a fresh </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">crop top</Text>
      <Text> into Parsley’s hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dea92426-14fc-429c-83f4-7e9485520dbc">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57e83af6-d3fb-401a-bc46-cc43c0292b49">
      <Text>Don’t puke on this one, okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eadb4572-ccc6-439a-ba60-1c58e877ac3e">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98d75abb-53e3-470d-87c1-7cf1ccfaa978">
      <Text>And don’t let the flowers bully you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b7a5b1da-e737-4cb2-85c3-37865b39f7de">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f35cc0ae-5174-4d19-adf1-8b35a0527267">
      <Text>Wait!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d87f5bfe-f591-435f-9aeb-93bfa6dd1436">
      <Text>Rau hands Pyrus the single bill.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7498c938-779a-43a6-8e13-700c1244c1d9">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c370795c-6182-40c4-b310-9ed1653659e0">
      <Text>A debt settled in sugar. I owe your </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">unty</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> is starting an internship and we’d like you to be our first intern.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f4a2bda-af1b-4da1-8dda-4fa602c62952">
      <Text Style="">PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="29a5478c-59ea-41b5-a516-6d8e6291f399">
      <Text>I’d probably get the salon shut down, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2b07990-e664-4009-9d8c-76135c795b84">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5f697fe-491d-483b-9715-021262dc0a36">
      <Text>Oh shut up, poop head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c943461-e758-4f38-b926-6fd281ed5efc">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">"TURNOVER (A NEW LEAF)" Song</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="09b84b58-97c4-455f-88d9-22df6fcbd85a">
      <Text Style="">PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c985675-bb12-4acf-91b0-0c4428ecb20f">
      <Text>I’d be supervised by </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">dat</Text>
      <Text>? </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">I</Text>
      <Text>’ll clean </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">dat</Text>
      <Text> dirt in ya mouth, ya sweetgrass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="395936c2-ac41-4691-844b-8fdfa0dde5f6">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d3dc1da4-e34d-438e-aadd-b426988cf6eb">
      <Text>Finally, someone else up for the task.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c89af41-952d-4949-9fd6-6d21140348c6">
      <Text Style="">PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9dd996c-c520-4b88-9264-593295e957e7">
      <Text>I cannot thank you enough, Ms. Ram.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9751fd5-6bc6-4936-b717-6aa362bfbb84">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d780106-6f57-4888-b681-b01a90c3f2f1">
      <Text>It’s my </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">turn</Text>
      <Text> to help you start </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">over</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2864f22d-c613-4746-9405-e8dc63967924">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5c5bdff-e86d-451d-b6bd-c12681687fe4">
      <Text>You’re welcome back any time!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8ccc08a-70ad-49da-bc4e-d69eed86fbed">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c79dd63d-6dce-471b-bde6-ea65d4c1a550">
      <Text>With Malus’s intent, there’s always a plot for you here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7594ecf2-7829-487e-b0cd-91ef24207ba5">
      <Text>Rau opens a colorful tanning bed, for Pyrus to sit and gleam.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db386231-11f9-4944-87ca-ab0559255312">
      <Text>Malus radiantly emerges from a neighboring bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b3fe3f1-1dac-435b-be74-d0ba352ef4c3">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="173a4db3-0737-45e9-8767-61be68d15e94">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Turn around!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6708897e-fa20-402b-af49-384a78311390">
      <Text>The doors of the salon fly open as a crowd of multicultural patrons floods in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="891312bf-c085-4721-afe2-50eccd70b90b">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="173cdaa5-884d-4ff6-b1a3-8ebf93e334a2">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We have changed them
Turn over pairs of fresh eyes
New leaves, colors
Turn over to this strange light</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05c7887d-d0d3-4a8c-be61-0e244c9c28df">
      <Text>Rau &amp; Malus </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="214d0377-df0d-4a5f-85b9-8c67e4ca1d21">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Light</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d8c9774-ee92-4f32-bf0f-c3ea7ec65605">
      <Text>Parsley, Rau, Pyrus, Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8350c281-bd11-4615-b9c8-fb256abcb02d">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">This Dirty City is our home
The neighbors, they’re known
to help us to sow our seeds and grow...
Turn over and change for the better</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="930d8f5f-8813-44e5-a255-e6831616fa2e">
      <Text>Rain falls outside, shimmering like glitter. Through the window, Rau sees a vision of her younger self and Cori Anh dancing on the site of the new </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="b12e3d90-d224-4e7d-89fa-e080d767fb82">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e2fc79f-3537-4f13-8587-8b0bc8203349">
          <Text>Parsley &amp; Rau</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0400b63c-7293-4d6e-8ccf-5f34223943ed">
          <Text Style="AllCaps">This is the spark of...
a floral partnership.
A friendship where I can rest our garden.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17e6df9f-007e-4dc8-a46d-5beb5c48b32c">
          <Text>Pyrus &amp; Malus</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91fae073-3f58-4eeb-a075-306798c5bdba">
          <Text Style="AllCaps">This is the spark of...
an herbal partnership.
A friendship that leaves the best shared garden.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b0e8bfc0-6009-48d8-918b-28deb6db1f25">
      <Text>Parsley and Pyrus flip the sign to </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">open</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="801c35e0-890a-400e-833d-0c29ed15bee6">
      <Text>Parsley, Rau, Malus, Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be28f3e4-93ae-431a-9442-30431a7fd6d5">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">But the best turnover we’ve had Is the sun!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6ead349-1f4f-47d1-82bd-4e46869bf874">
      <Text>A tanning bed opens, emitting a blinding sunlight that fills the screen. Bombus zips towards us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc55410c-4aef-49d8-a1a8-5e5c121985b6">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of "Turnover (A New Leaf)"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="1d320b91-3d75-450d-b607-e00bd1e3f4b8">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of ACT </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Underline+AllCaps">III</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="83fa2f5d-d836-42ac-959e-c373fd377193">
      <Text>Dip to White:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9194a7e2-e8fd-4622-b355-0c1edbdea2e8">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="80" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COMPANY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Dirty City - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13bb120f-3609-4489-9fb6-a7d48c28c312">
      <Text>Canna, Rau, Malus, the kids, and a crowd of townsfolk lead a parade towards the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="366da611-ba05-4d48-88f9-90b45241084c">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Through the camera:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd120b06-3a66-4faf-a550-ab171948b71b">
      <Text>Canna</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="02815ac9-f517-48ae-82d5-2ca5a9a0c1b8">
      <Text>(to us)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c3f8646b-b604-4193-b541-f04ad381628b">
      <Text>We hope you enjoyed your stay in Dirty City. Have a safe trip home. We’re rooting for you! Oh, and before you return to your home garden, let’s take a group photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5c83d29-4a1c-4ac7-8249-0307fa794ac3">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">"Bow - Photosynthesis" Song</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee0e3380-b516-4a0a-b236-4a030735b413">
      <Text>Company</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a807227d-23ff-451a-9a5a-41e4d1f962f7">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Photosynthesis! Photosynthesis!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4565f5fe-986c-41b0-8e63-d17333d50557">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12b99083-4b7a-4a4f-a17f-f4161c9be52c">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of "Bow - Photosynthesis"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="493e0ced-f991-4f31-992c-6ce28ef98aed">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6b2fbfe-aa79-46e5-9491-e8043110f976">
      <Text>The polaroid camera </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">prints</Text>
      <Text> the final photo. It's the perfect group photo with the community that Rau dreamed of since her lonely photo in the customs office.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="493e0ced-f991-4f31-992c-6ce28ef98aed">
      <Text>Below reads the end title: </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Photosynthesis (quang hop).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="End of Act" id="a3172081-1aa2-4f43-8d7a-8ffcbf054f4c">
      <Text>End of the Plot</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="09644d29-64f2-4d3e-a2ea-7382594991ac">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">Credits</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a5cc8f3c-346c-48e9-bf23-e906b6be5fae">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dedication</Text>
      <Text>: </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dedicated to Hue Ngoc Nguyen, Photographer, Gardener, and David Quang Pham’s mom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="a0ba4302-bea8-43b7-8062-16fe2334df00">
      <Picture Height="312" Id="7baec385-bce3-4fe0-b785-e5a158c1f124" Width="468"/>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a3116b7b-f8f9-4fc4-ba26-d5495148bb5c">
      <Text>The credits include real-life animation production photos or memories from </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Turnover: A New Leaf</Text>
      <Text> theatre performances.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

